(6366989, 943101, 52336, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely portrait.  I think this is well representative of Weston''s style -- the close frame/crop, the high contrast, the natural-looking light, and, if I may say so, the beautiful curls that look like 1930s-esque finger waves.  Very wonderfully done, thanks.</td>', 'That''s a lovely portrait.  I think this is well representative of Weston''s style -- the close frame/crop, the high contrast, the natural-looking light, and, if I may say so, the beautiful curls that look like 1930s-esque finger waves.  Very wonderfully done, thanks.', '2011-03-30 02:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366990, 942876, 36843, '<td valign="top">like the idea, the lighting works as well</td>', 'like the idea, the lighting works as well', '2011-03-30 02:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366992, 943668, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one to emulate, since it''s so famous.  Your version''s door is a bit heavy in the frame, I think, and is quite possibly even more contrasty than the original.  But this is an impressive homage, I must say, right down to the bobby pins!  Congratulations on that.</td>', 'This is a tough one to emulate, since it''s so famous.  Your version''s door is a bit heavy in the frame, I think, and is quite possibly even more contrasty than the original.  But this is an impressive homage, I must say, right down to the bobby pins!  Congratulations on that.', '2011-03-30 02:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366994, 943328, 36843, '<td valign="top">love the detail and texture here</td>', 'love the detail and texture here', '2011-03-30 02:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366996, 943423, 36843, '<td valign="top">kind of creepy cool</td>', 'kind of creepy cool', '2011-03-30 02:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367023, 943658, 48761, '<td valign="top">Not contrasty enough.  Even for Weston.  :-)</td>', 'Not contrasty enough.  Even for Weston.  :-)', '2011-03-30 02:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367026, 943667, 48761, '<td valign="top">Could be shadow-ier?  Perhaps shot in late afternoon?</td>', 'Could be shadow-ier?  Perhaps shot in late afternoon?', '2011-03-30 02:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367032, 943428, 48761, '<td valign="top">One of my faves.  Too controversial to be top 10, but on my top 10 for sure!</td>', 'One of my faves.  Too controversial to be top 10, but on my top 10 for sure!', '2011-03-30 02:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
