(6367038, 943633, 48761, '<td valign="top">Wall overexposed, model underexposed, model a little out of focus.  With a few technical changes this is a top 10 photo for sure, but fell a little short.</td>', 'Wall overexposed, model underexposed, model a little out of focus.  With a few technical changes this is a top 10 photo for sure, but fell a little short.', '2011-03-30 02:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
