(6367287, 943328, 54033, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2011-03-30 07:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367291, 943603, 20577, '<td valign="top">I hope this doesn''t get overloooked just because it isn''t in black and white. This is a fantastic shot and really has an Edward Weston feel to it. There are a lot of shots in this challenge that mimic his style, but this is actually the first one that I thought could have been his. Not sure exactly why... anyway, great shot!</td>', 'I hope this doesn''t get overloooked just because it isn''t in black and white. This is a fantastic shot and really has an Edward Weston feel to it. There are a lot of shots in this challenge that mimic his style, but this is actually the first one that I thought could have been his. Not sure exactly why... anyway, great shot!', '2011-03-30 07:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367293, 942545, 123833, '<td valign="top">My top for this challenge - is this the real Weston? Probably not, the sky is too dark</td>', 'My top for this challenge - is this the real Weston? Probably not, the sky is too dark', '2011-03-30 07:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367301, 943618, 110744, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and lighting.', '2011-03-30 08:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367390, 942876, 10785, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, great form. I think this is something Weston would have photographed had he encountered it! Great blacks and shadow, you did well with limiting the highlights. One thing I see that was not indicative of a Weston photo is the use of DoF. You used a shallower DoF than what I have seen in the Weston works that I have viewed. I think he would have shot this at f8, f11, f22, somewhere around there. I do really like this!</td>', 'Awesome lighting, great form. I think this is something Weston would have photographed had he encountered it! Great blacks and shadow, you did well with limiting the highlights. One thing I see that was not indicative of a Weston photo is the use of DoF. You used a shallower DoF than what I have seen in the Weston works that I have viewed. I think he would have shot this at f8, f11, f22, somewhere around there. I do really like this!', '2011-03-30 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367411, 942865, 15711, '<td valign="top">That guy looks like he could be kin to Woody Harrelson. I like it.  I still remember those old bulbs, you''d pop them out and almost burn your fingers.</td>', 'That guy looks like he could be kin to Woody Harrelson. I like it.  I still remember those old bulbs, you''d pop them out and almost burn your fingers.', '2011-03-30 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367413, 943101, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light.  I like the waves in your hair, adding a bit of texture and contrasting interest.  Love your jawline.</td>', 'Wonderful light.  I like the waves in your hair, adding a bit of texture and contrasting interest.  Love your jawline.', '2011-03-30 10:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367414, 942650, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this.  It has that sense of surrealism.</td>', 'Love this.  It has that sense of surrealism.', '2011-03-30 10:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367416, 942876, 15711, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that I like.  The low key lighting is great.</td>', 'There''s something about this that I like.  The low key lighting is great.', '2011-03-30 10:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6367417, 943139, 15711, '<td valign="top">That single hovering cloud is great.</td>', 'That single hovering cloud is great.', '2011-03-30 10:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
