(6368177, 943309, 124256, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like an existing Weston to me, but I think perfectly captures the motion, lighting, and form of his work.  Awesome!</td>', 'Doesn''t look like an existing Weston to me, but I think perfectly captures the motion, lighting, and form of his work.  Awesome!', '2011-03-30 21:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
