(6368328, 943365, 96751, '<td valign="top">This might be the closest entry I''ve seen in terms of recreating Weston''s style.  Although there have been many veggies, nudes, and shells, this one has achieved that marvelously rich lighting AND dof. The tonal range takes my breath away and the sheen on the pepper is perfect, as is the texture of the bg surface.  I see this placing at the top, or at the very least on the fp.  (not voting)</td>', 'This might be the closest entry I''ve seen in terms of recreating Weston''s style.  Although there have been many veggies, nudes, and shells, this one has achieved that marvelously rich lighting AND dof. The tonal range takes my breath away and the sheen on the pepper is perfect, as is the texture of the bg surface.  I see this placing at the top, or at the very least on the fp.  (not voting)', '2011-03-30 23:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
