(6368467, 942561, 86218, '<td valign="top">Good Weston image with use of dead bark/tree. Focus needsa to be there from bottom to top. Sharp at top but lacks it a bit at the bottom. Stil a nice comp you have going here</td>', 'Good Weston image with use of dead bark/tree. Focus needsa to be there from bottom to top. Sharp at top but lacks it a bit at the bottom. Stil a nice comp you have going here', '2011-03-31 03:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368477, 943488, 86218, '<td valign="top">Good portrait within the setting giving it much context and tells a story. Would like to see the mans face without movement and would def crop out the projector in the roof which really dates this picture no doubt.</td>', 'Good portrait within the setting giving it much context and tells a story. Would like to see the mans face without movement and would def crop out the projector in the roof which really dates this picture no doubt.', '2011-03-31 04:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368486, 943315, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice use of textures &amp; lines and tones. Like this and it works for me</td>', 'Nice use of textures & lines and tones. Like this and it works for me', '2011-03-31 05:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368585, 943668, 124256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful homage to a specific photo!  Even before looking back at the reference shot the door bothered me.  At first I thought it was too close; but looking at the Weston I think it''s just too bright.  In his shot the verticals of the model''s form are not interfered with by the door.  I think you only notice it on a second or closer look.  You captured wonderful form with your model, but the door is in the way and detracts in my opinion.  Also, if anything is sharply in focus, it seems to me that it''s the grain in the center of the door panel and possibly the back of the towel trim.  I think Weston would have the whole model in perfect focus.</td>', 'Beautiful homage to a specific photo!  Even before looking back at the reference shot the door bothered me.  At first I thought it was too close; but looking at the Weston I think it''s just too bright.  In his shot the verticals of the model''s form are not interfered with by the door.  I think you only notice it on a second or closer look.  You captured wonderful form with your model, but the door is in the way and detracts in my opinion.  Also, if anything is sharply in focus, it seems to me that it''s the grain in the center of the door panel and possibly the back of the towel trim.  I think Weston would have the whole model in perfect focus.', '2011-03-31 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368586, 943656, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  It doesn''t capture some of what I think is the best of Weston''s sense of form, though there is more to his work (I love it when he captures a subject with notable depth that is conspicuously flattened thus abstracted with his capture -- I think your subject was too flat to start with to recreate that).  With that in mind, I think the contrast, lighting, framing, and spirit of your shot are spot on.  I really like it.</td>', 'Nice shot!  It doesn''t capture some of what I think is the best of Weston''s sense of form, though there is more to his work (I love it when he captures a subject with notable depth that is conspicuously flattened thus abstracted with his capture -- I think your subject was too flat to start with to recreate that).  With that in mind, I think the contrast, lighting, framing, and spirit of your shot are spot on.  I really like it.', '2011-03-31 10:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368588, 943199, 124256, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  At first I thought it was a gourd, but now I''m thinking it''s a swan digging in the water.  That reaction alone I think demonstrates a great recreation of Weston''s approach.  I especially like that your subject is so different from what I have seen him do.  That said I think your shot has too much depth with the back being out of focus.  Still, I really like it.</td>', 'Awesome.  At first I thought it was a gourd, but now I''m thinking it''s a swan digging in the water.  That reaction alone I think demonstrates a great recreation of Weston''s approach.  I especially like that your subject is so different from what I have seen him do.  That said I think your shot has too much depth with the back being out of focus.  Still, I really like it.', '2011-03-31 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368590, 942701, 124256, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I think I like the way this one fits the challenge.  I don''t recall Weston shooting anything so close.  I do think your contrast range, lighting, framing, and presentation of form really echo his work well.  I especially like that your subject is so different while capturing his approach so well.  Awesome!</td>', 'Hmm, I think I like the way this one fits the challenge.  I don''t recall Weston shooting anything so close.  I do think your contrast range, lighting, framing, and presentation of form really echo his work well.  I especially like that your subject is so different while capturing his approach so well.  Awesome!', '2011-03-31 10:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368591, 942536, 124256, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I think Weston would have captured everything in focus, but I think this image works so well as is and echoes Weston''s aesthetic well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely.  I think Weston would have captured everything in focus, but I think this image works so well as is and echoes Weston''s aesthetic well.  Nicely done.', '2011-03-31 10:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368595, 942811, 124256, '<td valign="top">Yes.  I love the contrast, lighting, perspective, and framing.  I just think you show too much of the subject making it too easy to identify right away.  The dark area towards the bottom of the subject provides a secondary and contrasting focal point that makes it feel like too much is going on, especially for a Weston.</td>', 'Yes.  I love the contrast, lighting, perspective, and framing.  I just think you show too much of the subject making it too easy to identify right away.  The dark area towards the bottom of the subject provides a secondary and contrasting focal point that makes it feel like too much is going on, especially for a Weston.', '2011-03-31 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368597, 943037, 124256, '<td valign="top">With sharper focus at the top and more dramatic contrast I think would be a fantastic shot.  I really like your subject.</td>', 'With sharper focus at the top and more dramatic contrast I think would be a fantastic shot.  I really like your subject.', '2011-03-31 10:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368614, 943596, 112739, '<td valign="top">Good focal point where the water meets the tree.</td>', 'Good focal point where the water meets the tree.', '2011-03-31 11:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368616, 943616, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the shot but it doesn''t look very Weston to me.  Instead of being focused on form in an abstract-ish kind of way, this comes off more as a formless abstract collage.  Aside from the Westoniness, I really like it!</td>', 'I love the shot but it doesn''t look very Weston to me.  Instead of being focused on form in an abstract-ish kind of way, this comes off more as a formless abstract collage.  Aside from the Westoniness, I really like it!', '2011-03-31 11:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368617, 943658, 124256, '<td valign="top">The subject blends in with the rest too much, and at least based on the Weston shots I recall, this needs more contrast.  Maybe it''s just a Weston style I don''t care for as much.</td>', 'The subject blends in with the rest too much, and at least based on the Weston shots I recall, this needs more contrast.  Maybe it''s just a Weston style I don''t care for as much.', '2011-03-31 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368620, 943579, 99263, '<td valign="top">Horse Ass?</td>', 'Horse Ass?', '2011-03-31 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368622, 942849, 124256, '<td valign="top">The subject isn''t captured in what I think is a Weston way.  Instead of being slightly puzzled by form being flattened almost to abstract, this just looks like a gorgeous shot of flowers.  Having the entire subject(s) in focus would really help, but I think you need to look at your subject differently.  Perhaps where the flower on the left meets the stem would have more promise in my opinion.</td>', 'The subject isn''t captured in what I think is a Weston way.  Instead of being slightly puzzled by form being flattened almost to abstract, this just looks like a gorgeous shot of flowers.  Having the entire subject(s) in focus would really help, but I think you need to look at your subject differently.  Perhaps where the flower on the left meets the stem would have more promise in my opinion.', '2011-03-31 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368623, 943625, 112739, '<td valign="top">Its a kidney!</td>', 'Its a kidney!', '2011-03-31 11:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368626, 942936, 124256, '<td valign="top">The you have captured your subjects, form isn''t the star it needs to be to echo Weston.  Maybe tight cropping on the underside of the toadstool on the left would work better.  Very brave to submit in color :).</td>', 'The you have captured your subjects, form isn''t the star it needs to be to echo Weston.  Maybe tight cropping on the underside of the toadstool on the left would work better.  Very brave to submit in color :).', '2011-03-31 11:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368632, 943486, 112739, '<td valign="top">Most people want to know why a low score came in, I''m one of those that like to know the reason. I''m scoreing this low for the lack of original thinking in taking a photograph in the Weston style.</td>', 'Most people want to know why a low score came in, I''m one of those that like to know the reason. I''m scoreing this low for the lack of original thinking in taking a photograph in the Weston style.', '2011-03-31 11:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368634, 943597, 112739, '<td valign="top">Need more DOF. Weston never used an open aperture on his close up shots.</td>', 'Need more DOF. Weston never used an open aperture on his close up shots.', '2011-03-31 11:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368638, 943199, 112739, '<td valign="top">Original thinking! Nice. The only thing I have is the lack of DOF. 8 for original thinking and good execution in this challenge.</td>', 'Original thinking! Nice. The only thing I have is the lack of DOF. 8 for original thinking and good execution in this challenge.', '2011-03-31 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368640, 943426, 112739, '<td valign="top">love it. 8</td>', 'love it. 8', '2011-03-31 11:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368643, 942498, 112739, '<td valign="top">nice re-creation, but no original thinking here. But very well done though.</td>', 'nice re-creation, but no original thinking here. But very well done though.', '2011-03-31 11:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368644, 943332, 112739, '<td valign="top">Nice light. Good contrast. My first impression was of leaves of corn.</td>', 'Nice light. Good contrast. My first impression was of leaves of corn.', '2011-03-31 11:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368645, 943309, 112739, '<td valign="top">I see many areas that are OOF. Lighting is fabulous. Reminds me of a clenched fist and ready to either impode or explode, not sure which but a strong sense of an impending very sudden movement. I''m glad it''s not a pepper, or a nude, or a mushroom. going with a 8 for now.</td>', 'I see many areas that are OOF. Lighting is fabulous. Reminds me of a clenched fist and ready to either impode or explode, not sure which but a strong sense of an impending very sudden movement. I''m glad it''s not a pepper, or a nude, or a mushroom. going with a 8 for now.', '2011-03-31 11:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368648, 943627, 112739, '<td valign="top">The chain sawed off end is just not fitting. A re-composure is needed to bring out the life in the subject.</td>', 'The chain sawed off end is just not fitting. A re-composure is needed to bring out the life in the subject.', '2011-03-31 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368649, 943003, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very good rendition.</td>', 'Very good rendition.', '2011-03-31 11:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368652, 943482, 112739, '<td valign="top">Upon first viewing, one does get a brief sense of someone leaning against a wall or some other object. Interesting indeed.</td>', 'Upon first viewing, one does get a brief sense of someone leaning against a wall or some other object. Interesting indeed.', '2011-03-31 11:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368657, 943579, 113156, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and shapely, wonderful nude, its rare that you get dragged into a photo by the form, but this does just that.</td>', 'Beautiful and shapely, wonderful nude, its rare that you get dragged into a photo by the form, but this does just that.', '2011-03-31 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368661, 943643, 113156, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2011-03-31 12:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368665, 943365, 112739, '<td valign="top">Excellent rendition, the best pepper in the challenge. But not original. There is even an imperfection, just like the original.</td>', 'Excellent rendition, the best pepper in the challenge. But not original. There is even an imperfection, just like the original.', '2011-03-31 12:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368677, 942876, 112739, '<td valign="top">very nice. Excellent original work.</td>', 'very nice. Excellent original work.', '2011-03-31 12:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368683, 943497, 112739, '<td valign="top">9, not just for the water resemblence of the numural 9, but for really doing a great job of using what Weston thought most important.</td>', '9, not just for the water resemblence of the numural 9, but for really doing a great job of using what Weston thought most important.', '2011-03-31 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368691, 943182, 2612, '<td valign="top">Exceptional work and an excellent match for the challenge. I''m excited to find out who shot this.</td>', 'Exceptional work and an excellent match for the challenge. I''m excited to find out who shot this.', '2011-03-31 12:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368700, 943284, 126838, '<td valign="top">Great styling...</td>', 'Great styling...', '2011-03-31 12:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368701, 943656, 126838, '<td valign="top">Nicely done....</td>', 'Nicely done....', '2011-03-31 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368703, 943618, 126838, '<td valign="top">The lighting is beautiful........very nice..</td>', 'The lighting is beautiful........very nice..', '2011-03-31 12:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368709, 943089, 126838, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2011-03-31 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368710, 942658, 126838, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile.I really like the way this was composed. The lines and curves look great.</td>', 'This makes me smile.I really like the way this was composed. The lines and curves look great.', '2011-03-31 12:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368711, 943668, 126838, '<td valign="top">Very well replicated, fabulous attention to detail.</td>', 'Very well replicated, fabulous attention to detail.', '2011-03-31 12:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368712, 942777, 126838, '<td valign="top">The contrast and curves are wonderful.</td>', 'The contrast and curves are wonderful.', '2011-03-31 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368714, 943008, 126838, '<td valign="top">Lovely curves</td>', 'Lovely curves', '2011-03-31 12:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368715, 942369, 126838, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model...</td>', 'A beautiful model...', '2011-03-31 12:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368718, 943335, 126838, '<td valign="top">Soft image with nice curves...I wish your model had not worn earrings...</td>', 'Soft image with nice curves...I wish your model had not worn earrings...', '2011-03-31 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368719, 943181, 126838, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and contrast</td>', 'Nice lighting and contrast', '2011-03-31 12:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368720, 943655, 126838, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines...</td>', 'Lovely lines...', '2011-03-31 13:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368721, 942410, 126838, '<td valign="top">A very pretty tribute, this image has a timeless quality</td>', 'A very pretty tribute, this image has a timeless quality', '2011-03-31 13:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368722, 943627, 126838, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...great B&amp;W image</td>', 'Nicely done...great B&W image', '2011-03-31 13:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368724, 943570, 126838, '<td valign="top">The black sand has wonderful texture and curves. The overall image just has a little too much noise.</td>', 'The black sand has wonderful texture and curves. The overall image just has a little too much noise.', '2011-03-31 13:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368726, 943328, 126838, '<td valign="top">Fabulous texture well lit. I find the shadow split a little distracting.</td>', 'Fabulous texture well lit. I find the shadow split a little distracting.', '2011-03-31 13:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368727, 942997, 126838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful curves and beautifully composed...you created an emotional feel with this....wow!</td>', 'Beautiful curves and beautifully composed...you created an emotional feel with this....wow!', '2011-03-31 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368728, 942852, 126838, '<td valign="top">What a great eye you have!</td>', 'What a great eye you have!', '2011-03-31 13:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368729, 943605, 126838, '<td valign="top">Great form and curves, the background is a little busy..</td>', 'Great form and curves, the background is a little busy..', '2011-03-31 13:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368730, 943596, 126838, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2011-03-31 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368732, 943309, 126838, '<td valign="top">This is a strong image</td>', 'This is a strong image', '2011-03-31 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368734, 943633, 126838, '<td valign="top">The setting gives this image a negative feel.</td>', 'The setting gives this image a negative feel.', '2011-03-31 13:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368735, 943003, 126838, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...</td>', 'Nicely done...', '2011-03-31 13:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368737, 943442, 126838, '<td valign="top">Cheeky!</td>', 'Cheeky!', '2011-03-31 13:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368738, 943603, 126838, '<td valign="top">A black and white conversion would look great</td>', 'A black and white conversion would look great', '2011-03-31 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368740, 943635, 126838, '<td valign="top">Your pose looks uncomfortable... The setting is cold...</td>', 'Your pose looks uncomfortable... The setting is cold...', '2011-03-31 13:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368771, 943101, 124256, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great detail with perfect focus.  I love the dark/light contrast.  I especially like the subtly lighter background versus the even darker sweater.  The sense of emotion is great.  Great shot!</td>', 'Very nice.  Great detail with perfect focus.  I love the dark/light contrast.  I especially like the subtly lighter background versus the even darker sweater.  The sense of emotion is great.  Great shot!', '2011-03-31 14:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368773, 943655, 124256, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I''d like it even more if the darks were darker or at least more dark.  I don''t know why.  I think for more Westoniness there needs to be more balance.  Probably just me.</td>', 'Awesome.  I''d like it even more if the darks were darker or at least more dark.  I don''t know why.  I think for more Westoniness there needs to be more balance.  Probably just me.', '2011-03-31 14:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368775, 943643, 124256, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Lighting, focus, and framing are all very Weston.  The light colored peppers are perfect.  The dark one in the center really detracts from the shot for me.  It looks too common or ordinary.  It makes it clear we''re looking at peppers and it''s form is definitely not a star (like for the others).</td>', 'Awesome.  Lighting, focus, and framing are all very Weston.  The light colored peppers are perfect.  The dark one in the center really detracts from the shot for me.  It looks too common or ordinary.  It makes it clear we''re looking at peppers and it''s form is definitely not a star (like for the others).', '2011-03-31 14:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368778, 942852, 124256, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  It was a delayed reaction for me to see what I think I''m supposed to see.  I think very Weston.  Well played.  I just wish it had richer darks.</td>', 'Brilliant!  It was a delayed reaction for me to see what I think I''m supposed to see.  I think very Weston.  Well played.  I just wish it had richer darks.', '2011-03-31 14:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368779, 943611, 124256, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going for.  I like it, but I think it misses the Weston mark.  In a shot like this I think he would have captured more curves and avoided a central focal point.  As it is, I think you ended up with pie slices instead of compelling form.</td>', 'I think I see what you were going for.  I like it, but I think it misses the Weston mark.  In a shot like this I think he would have captured more curves and avoided a central focal point.  As it is, I think you ended up with pie slices instead of compelling form.', '2011-03-31 14:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368802, 943238, 123297, '<td valign="top">Sweet light on the water. good job</td>', 'Sweet light on the water. good job', '2011-03-31 15:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368803, 942597, 123297, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2011-03-31 15:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368804, 943636, 112739, '<td valign="top">Think you might something here IMO. Very, very good.<br/> <br/>Came back to raise this to my only 10 and the winner for the Challenge.</td>', 'Think you might something here IMO. Very, very good. Came back to raise this to my only 10 and the winner for the Challenge.', '2011-03-31 15:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368807, 943652, 112739, '<td valign="top">Came back to bump this up to an 8. It appears a little over sharpened but a great shot non the less.</td>', 'Came back to bump this up to an 8. It appears a little over sharpened but a great shot non the less.', '2011-03-31 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368895, 943284, 112972, '<td valign="top">Very unique entry.  I assume you intentionally didn''t want to give it more contrast.  After having looked at Weston''s images, it seems to me, he tried to give his images good amount of contrast.  I think the lack of contrast might hurt your score a little bit, but I still like the "old photo" look you have given to this. Bumping this one to 8.  I like it even more now.</td>', 'Very unique entry.  I assume you intentionally didn''t want to give it more contrast.  After having looked at Weston''s images, it seems to me, he tried to give his images good amount of contrast.  I think the lack of contrast might hurt your score a little bit, but I still like the "old photo" look you have given to this. Bumping this one to 8.  I like it even more now.', '2011-03-31 17:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368896, 942921, 130157, '<td valign="top">nice photo.</td>', 'nice photo.', '2011-03-31 17:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368945, 942748, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I really like the sharp focus.  I think it misses the Weston mark though.  I don''t think this emphasizes form abstracting away the actual object enough.  I think Weston''s cabbage shots were all leaves draped like dresses or tightly cropped cross sections.  As is this doesn''t say Weston to me.</td>', 'Great shot, I really like the sharp focus.  I think it misses the Weston mark though.  I don''t think this emphasizes form abstracting away the actual object enough.  I think Weston''s cabbage shots were all leaves draped like dresses or tightly cropped cross sections.  As is this doesn''t say Weston to me.', '2011-03-31 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368946, 942775, 124256, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  First off I really like this shot (favorited).  However, I don''t see how this is supposed to relate to Weston''s work.  The shallow DOF seems complete contrary to his approach, and I think this kills any chances of your shot prioritizing (and possibly abstracting through flattening) form.</td>', 'Interesting.  First off I really like this shot (favorited).  However, I don''t see how this is supposed to relate to Weston''s work.  The shallow DOF seems complete contrary to his approach, and I think this kills any chances of your shot prioritizing (and possibly abstracting through flattening) form.', '2011-03-31 18:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368951, 943423, 124256, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I haven''t seen the right Weston photos, but this seems way off the mark to me.  I like the shot, I am compelled to keep looking at it and enjoy figuring out what I think it all is.  Still, it does not seem at all Westony to me.  Most importantly I don''t think he would approve of the halo/glow.  Nor do I think he would shoot through a fan so beautifully out of focus (or whatever that is -- are you on a boat?).</td>', 'I don''t know if I haven''t seen the right Weston photos, but this seems way off the mark to me.  I like the shot, I am compelled to keep looking at it and enjoy figuring out what I think it all is.  Still, it does not seem at all Westony to me.  Most importantly I don''t think he would approve of the halo/glow.  Nor do I think he would shoot through a fan so beautifully out of focus (or whatever that is -- are you on a boat?).', '2011-03-31 18:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368963, 943191, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this is the best in the challenge.', '2011-03-31 19:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368964, 943328, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting to bring out the textures.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting to bring out the textures.', '2011-03-31 19:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368993, 943238, 130632, '<td valign="top">d</td>', 'd', '2011-03-31 19:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368998, 942635, 76335, '<td valign="top">Has an unsettling rhythm to it. Nice.</td>', 'Has an unsettling rhythm to it. Nice.', '2011-03-31 20:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6368999, 942777, 76335, '<td valign="top">Perfect marriage of texture and shadow.</td>', 'Perfect marriage of texture and shadow.', '2011-03-31 20:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369000, 942961, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is the Weston I know.</td>', 'This is the Weston I know.', '2011-03-31 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369002, 943633, 130632, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous picture.... the dungeon like surroundings are amazing contrast to the petite and delicate model.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous picture.... the dungeon like surroundings are amazing contrast to the petite and delicate model.', '2011-03-31 20:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369003, 942718, 76335, '<td valign="top">Full of organic quirkiness. Nicely Weston.</td>', 'Full of organic quirkiness. Nicely Weston.', '2011-03-31 20:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369008, 942597, 76335, '<td valign="top">Amazing that black and white can convey so much color...</td>', 'Amazing that black and white can convey so much color...', '2011-03-31 20:11:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6369009, 943592, 76335, '<td valign="top">Perfect. The light is sublime.</td>', 'Perfect. The light is sublime.', '2011-03-31 20:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369010, 943605, 76335, '<td valign="top">They do look cozy.</td>', 'They do look cozy.', '2011-03-31 20:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369032, 942658, 12076, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Perhaps just a tad less subtle than a Weston image, but that makes it better, in my opinion.  Maybe I would try a tighter crop.  Nevertheless, one of the best.  8.</td>', 'I like this.  Perhaps just a tad less subtle than a Weston image, but that makes it better, in my opinion.  Maybe I would try a tighter crop.  Nevertheless, one of the best.  8.', '2011-03-31 20:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369037, 942369, 12076, '<td valign="top">I think this is my fav in the challenge.  Fantastic portrait, in the Weston style in my opinion.  9</td>', 'I think this is my fav in the challenge.  Fantastic portrait, in the Weston style in my opinion.  9', '2011-03-31 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369039, 943335, 12076, '<td valign="top">I am blown away by the perfect lighting on your model.  The ''forced'' pose doesn''t look forced at all.  Just great.</td>', 'I am blown away by the perfect lighting on your model.  The ''forced'' pose doesn''t look forced at all.  Just great.', '2011-03-31 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369041, 942597, 12076, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo.  The face is unusual, suggesting some sort of illness or whatnot.  But it doesn''t seem to be about that.  I am forced to stare and wonder.  Great.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo.  The face is unusual, suggesting some sort of illness or whatnot.  But it doesn''t seem to be about that.  I am forced to stare and wonder.  Great.', '2011-03-31 20:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369043, 943282, 12076, '<td valign="top">From my experience in this challenge, getting the light right on a vegi is not easy.  Well done here and a 7 from me.</td>', 'From my experience in this challenge, getting the light right on a vegi is not easy.  Well done here and a 7 from me.', '2011-03-31 20:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369047, 943087, 12076, '<td valign="top">Definitely Westonesque.  The type of photo of his that doesn''t particularly appeal to me.  But pulled off very well here.  Very subtle bit of personification in the tangled branches.  Very good for the challenge, IMHO.</td>', 'Definitely Westonesque.  The type of photo of his that doesn''t particularly appeal to me.  But pulled off very well here.  Very subtle bit of personification in the tangled branches.  Very good for the challenge, IMHO.', '2011-03-31 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369049, 942661, 12076, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this.  Well almost everything.  I gave it an 8.  My opinion, which is worth everything you paid for it, is that I wish the finger in the hair wasn''t separated from the rest of the hand.  And I would like to see just a shadow or faint image of what she is sitting on.  But what do I know.  Very nice!</td>', 'I like everything about this.  Well almost everything.  I gave it an 8.  My opinion, which is worth everything you paid for it, is that I wish the finger in the hair wasn''t separated from the rest of the hand.  And I would like to see just a shadow or faint image of what she is sitting on.  But what do I know.  Very nice!', '2011-03-31 20:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369050, 943284, 12076, '<td valign="top">Another wonderful portrait in the Weston style, IMHO.  Interesting that many of his shots are rather high contrast, but from what I have seen, his portraits are generally not so.  8</td>', 'Another wonderful portrait in the Weston style, IMHO.  Interesting that many of his shots are rather high contrast, but from what I have seen, his portraits are generally not so.  8', '2011-03-31 20:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369052, 943365, 12076, '<td valign="top">Perfect, as far as the Weston style is concerned. (Except maybe a 4x5 crop would be even more Wetonesque.)  For me, achieving the wonderful tones you have here was not possible due to my skill level.   9</td>', 'Perfect, as far as the Weston style is concerned. (Except maybe a 4x5 crop would be even more Wetonesque.)  For me, achieving the wonderful tones you have here was not possible due to my skill level.   9', '2011-03-31 20:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369055, 943625, 12076, '<td valign="top">Yup.  Right on the money.  I am a fan of a white "print-like" border, but you might get a comment or two about that.  A unique form that invites me to personify the tomato.  Tones and contrast...  heck...  is this an actual Weston photo??<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Yup.  Right on the money.  I am a fan of a white "print-like" border, but you might get a comment or two about that.  A unique form that invites me to personify the tomato.  Tones and contrast...  heck...  is this an actual Weston photo?? 9', '2011-03-31 20:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369057, 943428, 12076, '<td valign="top">Ha!  You have the toilet, the gas mask, the nude...  and is that a plate of fruit or veggies?  Nice... 8</td>', 'Ha!  You have the toilet, the gas mask, the nude...  and is that a plate of fruit or veggies?  Nice... 8', '2011-03-31 20:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369059, 943579, 12076, '<td valign="top">Every time I come back to this I like it more and bump it a notch.  Better than Weston.</td>', 'Every time I come back to this I like it more and bump it a notch.  Better than Weston.', '2011-03-31 20:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369071, 942997, 12076, '<td valign="top">Front page material.  Love the tones, detail and contrast.  While I think some of Weston''s fruits/veggies mimic the human form, subtly, here I am am reminded of birds.  Or sea lions. If I was to nit pik, and I won''t, I would say a 4x5 (or 5x4) crop would be more Weston''esque.  No matter though.  9 from me.</td>', 'Front page material.  Love the tones, detail and contrast.  While I think some of Weston''s fruits/veggies mimic the human form, subtly, here I am am reminded of birds.  Or sea lions. If I was to nit pik, and I won''t, I would say a 4x5 (or 5x4) crop would be more Weston''esque.  No matter though.  9 from me.', '2011-03-31 20:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369073, 943488, 12076, '<td valign="top">I like this type of photo..  this man in his element.  At first I didn''t like the movement from what I presume is a slow shutter speed handheld.  Now I am not so sure.  Almost appropriate considering the environment.</td>', 'I like this type of photo..  this man in his element.  At first I didn''t like the movement from what I presume is a slow shutter speed handheld.  Now I am not so sure.  Almost appropriate considering the environment.', '2011-03-31 21:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369077, 942498, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best of the shells in this challenge, but it still leaves me wanting.  The lighting is ok, but it doesn''t reach Weston''s level, where the shell looked absolutely silky and luminous, almost as if the light was emanating from it.  It might have helped to dodge the highlights down the middle of the shell (I''ve heard that''s how Weston did it).</td>', 'This is probably the best of the shells in this challenge, but it still leaves me wanting.  The lighting is ok, but it doesn''t reach Weston''s level, where the shell looked absolutely silky and luminous, almost as if the light was emanating from it.  It might have helped to dodge the highlights down the middle of the shell (I''ve heard that''s how Weston did it).', '2011-03-31 21:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369084, 943315, 126838, '<td valign="top">The lines on the tree and shell are competing, maybe bumping up the contrast would give it more impact.</td>', 'The lines on the tree and shell are competing, maybe bumping up the contrast would give it more impact.', '2011-03-31 21:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369086, 942650, 12076, '<td valign="top">This one has me a bit confused.  Which is good IMHO. I looked at a number of Weston photographs, but missed any that had a foot.  Anyway, I don''t particularly like looking at guys hairy legs.  BUT, the tones, the perspective, the detail, and the sense of motion imparted by the ''foot rest''  are all very cool.  And to top it off it looks very ''filmy'' or film-like.  So...  I gave it a nine.  Hairy mans leg and all.</td>', 'This one has me a bit confused.  Which is good IMHO. I looked at a number of Weston photographs, but missed any that had a foot.  Anyway, I don''t particularly like looking at guys hairy legs.  BUT, the tones, the perspective, the detail, and the sense of motion imparted by the ''foot rest''  are all very cool.  And to top it off it looks very ''filmy'' or film-like.  So...  I gave it a nine.  Hairy mans leg and all.', '2011-03-31 21:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369094, 942498, 126838, '<td valign="top">The contours are really well defined...</td>', 'The contours are really well defined...', '2011-03-31 21:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369095, 943282, 126838, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity.</td>', 'Amazing clarity.', '2011-03-31 21:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369099, 943228, 126838, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop IMHO...</td>', 'A tighter crop IMHO...', '2011-03-31 21:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369101, 942915, 126838, '<td valign="top">Very nice rolling curves....</td>', 'Very nice rolling curves....', '2011-03-31 21:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369107, 943463, 126838, '<td valign="top">Somehow the contrast looks a bit flat...</td>', 'Somehow the contrast looks a bit flat...', '2011-03-31 21:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369112, 943017, 126838, '<td valign="top">This may have worked better with a bigger focus</td>', 'This may have worked better with a bigger focus', '2011-03-31 21:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369113, 942500, 126838, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image however on my screen it looks a little dark</td>', 'This is a nice image however on my screen it looks a little dark', '2011-03-31 21:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369117, 942597, 126838, '<td valign="top">The poor mans face looks so broken...its a great B&amp;W just hard to look at...</td>', 'The poor mans face looks so broken...its a great B&W just hard to look at...', '2011-03-31 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369118, 942735, 126838, '<td valign="top">I wish you had the cabbage turned around the other way</td>', 'I wish you had the cabbage turned around the other way', '2011-03-31 21:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369124, 943191, 126838, '<td valign="top">I like how the light catches on the shell just wish the outline was better defined..</td>', 'I like how the light catches on the shell just wish the outline was better defined..', '2011-03-31 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369125, 943426, 124256, '<td valign="top">Hmm, seems a stretch for the Weston but I''ll allow it ;).  I like the focus, contrast, balance of light and dark, and overall composition for Wesontality.  It doesn''t seem Westony but it feels Westony to me.  I will say I like it.</td>', 'Hmm, seems a stretch for the Weston but I''ll allow it ;).  I like the focus, contrast, balance of light and dark, and overall composition for Wesontality.  It doesn''t seem Westony but it feels Westony to me.  I will say I like it.', '2011-03-31 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369127, 942674, 126838, '<td valign="top">Full focus would have been nice</td>', 'Full focus would have been nice', '2011-03-31 21:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369132, 943604, 126838, '<td valign="top">This looks a little dark on my screen</td>', 'This looks a little dark on my screen', '2011-03-31 21:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369140, 942690, 126838, '<td valign="top">This has great contrast..</td>', 'This has great contrast..', '2011-03-31 21:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369142, 942695, 126838, '<td valign="top">Yes it is....nice job!</td>', 'Yes it is....nice job!', '2011-03-31 21:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369145, 943365, 126838, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of curves...the folds give it nice contrast</td>', 'This has a lot of curves...the folds give it nice contrast', '2011-03-31 21:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369147, 943595, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but it doesn''t seem Westony to me.  I think this approach has promise and is certainly a creative way to try to capture the Weston spirit.  As much as I love the intensity gradient on the edges of the Tronesque smoke, it evokes the sense of depth that Weston seems to flatten out into abstraction.  Whether or not the trailing/weaker edges of the smoke are in focus, they seem out of focus, again defeating what I think Weston would strive for in this shot.  Finally, I don''t think the form is the star here and it doesn''t lend for ambiguity.  The smoke itself automatically lends itself to abstraction, so it can''t be abstracted further.  A tighter crop may have tricked the eye into seeing something else, and that''s where I think this type of approach could have some Westonish promise.  As is I think it misses that mark.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but it doesn''t seem Westony to me.  I think this approach has promise and is certainly a creative way to try to capture the Weston spirit.  As much as I love the intensity gradient on the edges of the Tronesque smoke, it evokes the sense of depth that Weston seems to flatten out into abstraction.  Whether or not the trailing/weaker edges of the smoke are in focus, they seem out of focus, again defeating what I think Weston would strive for in this shot.  Finally, I don''t think the form is the star here and it doesn''t lend for ambiguity.  The smoke itself automatically lends itself to abstraction, so it can''t be abstracted further.  A tighter crop may have tricked the eye into seeing something else, and that''s where I think this type of approach could have some Westonish promise.  As is I think it misses that mark.', '2011-03-31 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369157, 943089, 12076, '<td valign="top">Great quote.  But for me, I have to switch it around....  "Is art like love..?"<br/> <br/>So..  the image-  Proper Weston crop; slightly high contrast.  In fact, when I think of his peppers they beg for personification.  And so does this cat.  This is a well executed cat portrait in the style of Weston.  Not necessarily his subject matter.  Oh, and too bad for me...  I really don''t like cats.  Terrible allergies.  But I can''t help but bump this one up on my second look.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great quote.  But for me, I have to switch it around....  "Is art like love..?" So..  the image-  Proper Weston crop; slightly high contrast.  In fact, when I think of his peppers they beg for personification.  And so does this cat.  This is a well executed cat portrait in the style of Weston.  Not necessarily his subject matter.  Oh, and too bad for me...  I really don''t like cats.  Terrible allergies.  But I can''t help but bump this one up on my second look.  Good luck!', '2011-03-31 21:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369163, 942852, 12076, '<td valign="top"><b>Mr.</b> White Oak, I presume?  And someone put some pants on that guy!<br/> <br/>Sorry.  I got carried away.  Looks like the lighting was tough, but you pulled it off.  Nice tones, and the hint of personification evident in some of Weston''s photos.  Gets better the longer I look at it.  Good luck!</td>', 'Mr. White Oak, I presume?  And someone put some pants on that guy! Sorry.  I got carried away.  Looks like the lighting was tough, but you pulled it off.  Nice tones, and the hint of personification evident in some of Weston''s photos.  Gets better the longer I look at it.  Good luck!', '2011-03-31 21:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369167, 942704, 124256, '<td valign="top">My read on Weston''s building shots, particularly barns, is that he treats them like American Gothic.  Matter of fact, not flattering, dead center, no drama.  This is a beautiful shot of a barn, I like it a lot.  I don''t think it reflects Weston''s style though.</td>', 'My read on Weston''s building shots, particularly barns, is that he treats them like American Gothic.  Matter of fact, not flattering, dead center, no drama.  This is a beautiful shot of a barn, I like it a lot.  I don''t think it reflects Weston''s style though.', '2011-03-31 22:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369170, 943603, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like that you forsake Weston''s bw.  Sadly I don''t think it helps.  This is a nice shot, I really sense emotion from the subject and feel like I can identify with how she feels somehow.  I think this kind of empathy is conspicuously missing from Weston''s work (my opinion).  So, I think it misses the Weston style, but is a great shot!</td>', 'I like that you forsake Weston''s bw.  Sadly I don''t think it helps.  This is a nice shot, I really sense emotion from the subject and feel like I can identify with how she feels somehow.  I think this kind of empathy is conspicuously missing from Weston''s work (my opinion).  So, I think it misses the Weston style, but is a great shot!', '2011-03-31 22:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369179, 943597, 124256, '<td valign="top">The tomatoes don''t seem to be in focus and there''s too much depth apparent overall.  Form isn''t the star and to me isn''t even very interesting in this shot.  I think this is an interesting shot, but it doesn''t resonate Weston to me.</td>', 'The tomatoes don''t seem to be in focus and there''s too much depth apparent overall.  Form isn''t the star and to me isn''t even very interesting in this shot.  I think this is an interesting shot, but it doesn''t resonate Weston to me.', '2011-03-31 22:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369181, 943476, 91783, '<td valign="top">very very pretty girl!</td>', 'very very pretty girl!', '2011-03-31 22:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369182, 943101, 91783, '<td valign="top">beautiful SP. :)</td>', 'beautiful SP. :)', '2011-03-31 22:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369183, 943008, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like your cropping.  Your shot almost evokes alternative forms in its ambiguity, but I never stop seeing just the rose, however gorgeous.  Also I think Weston would have kept everything in focus.  There is too much sense of depth versus Weston''s flattening to abstract form.</td>', 'I like your cropping.  Your shot almost evokes alternative forms in its ambiguity, but I never stop seeing just the rose, however gorgeous.  Also I think Weston would have kept everything in focus.  There is too much sense of depth versus Weston''s flattening to abstract form.', '2011-03-31 22:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369186, 942999, 124256, '<td valign="top">Sorry this doesn''t seem Westony to me at all.  Maybe I just don''t see your vision or know Weston enough.  I like the shot a lot, but the subject, cropping, deepness of the blacks (or not), abstractiness, and obsession with form all seem to miss the Weston style.</td>', 'Sorry this doesn''t seem Westony to me at all.  Maybe I just don''t see your vision or know Weston enough.  I like the shot a lot, but the subject, cropping, deepness of the blacks (or not), abstractiness, and obsession with form all seem to miss the Weston style.', '2011-03-31 22:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369187, 943650, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I had to go find analogous shots by Weston to properly look at it.  I think you pulled it off.  I''m not sure quite why, but this shot evokes the same kind of feeling I get looking at vaguely similar Weston shots.  I wish I could quantify it better.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I had to go find analogous shots by Weston to properly look at it.  I think you pulled it off.  I''m not sure quite why, but this shot evokes the same kind of feeling I get looking at vaguely similar Weston shots.  I wish I could quantify it better.', '2011-03-31 22:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369190, 942695, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice homage.  Somehow this shot doesn''t convey Weston''s dispassionate obsession with overall form.  Too much attention is drawn to the left knee, in fact it almost seems framed as a focal point.  Perhaps a different angle and more diffuse lighting would help.</td>', 'Nice homage.  Somehow this shot doesn''t convey Weston''s dispassionate obsession with overall form.  Too much attention is drawn to the left knee, in fact it almost seems framed as a focal point.  Perhaps a different angle and more diffuse lighting would help.', '2011-03-31 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369191, 942635, 124256, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t find a Weston shot vaguely similar.  So, going off what I have found, I don''t think he would have taken a shot like this.  If he did, he would have figured out a way to keep all the faces in focus.  Aside from that, very nice, very cool shot.</td>', 'I couldn''t find a Weston shot vaguely similar.  So, going off what I have found, I don''t think he would have taken a shot like this.  If he did, he would have figured out a way to keep all the faces in focus.  Aside from that, very nice, very cool shot.', '2011-03-31 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369193, 943328, 124256, '<td valign="top">The texture is fantastic.  Based on my read of Weston though, I don''t think this hits it.  I think Weston is more obsessed by form, motion, and tends towards the abstract.  There is practically an X in the center of a circle on this subject at your angle, the form does not suggest motion at all, and the subject does not come off as abstract.  Instead it is very matter of fact.  Doing a cross section or pulling off a leaf and shooting more tightly cropped I think would really help.</td>', 'The texture is fantastic.  Based on my read of Weston though, I don''t think this hits it.  I think Weston is more obsessed by form, motion, and tends towards the abstract.  There is practically an X in the center of a circle on this subject at your angle, the form does not suggest motion at all, and the subject does not come off as abstract.  Instead it is very matter of fact.  Doing a cross section or pulling off a leaf and shooting more tightly cropped I think would really help.', '2011-03-31 22:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369196, 943484, 124256, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going for here.  Looking over Weston''s banana shots I think they are tricky.  Your framing/cropping definitely echo Weston.  Personally I think the dynamic range (lacking sufficient darks), focus, and texture miss the Weston note.</td>', 'I think I see what you were going for here.  Looking over Weston''s banana shots I think they are tricky.  Your framing/cropping definitely echo Weston.  Personally I think the dynamic range (lacking sufficient darks), focus, and texture miss the Weston note.', '2011-03-31 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369199, 943453, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I would have titled this something more like Behind the scenes, Between shots, Unfinished, or Under construction Weston shot.  I wish the blacks were deeper.  I like your tribute.</td>', 'Nice.  I would have titled this something more like Behind the scenes, Between shots, Unfinished, or Under construction Weston shot.  I wish the blacks were deeper.  I like your tribute.', '2011-03-31 22:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369208, 943315, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I like how the shell is being assimilated by the wood.  The shot doesn''t seem Westony to me though.  I don''t think Weston would have made this shot.  I don''t think there''s enough balance between the darks and lights.  This is a great shot for texture, but I think Weston is far more concerned with form and the abstraction thereof in part through flattening depth.  I think it misses the mark.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I like how the shell is being assimilated by the wood.  The shot doesn''t seem Westony to me though.  I don''t think Weston would have made this shot.  I don''t think there''s enough balance between the darks and lights.  This is a great shot for texture, but I think Weston is far more concerned with form and the abstraction thereof in part through flattening depth.  I think it misses the mark.', '2011-03-31 23:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369213, 943062, 124256, '<td valign="top">I think Weston''s shots of buildings are like American Gothic.  Matter of fact, centered, no frills, dispassionate.  I think you''ve accomplished that here.  I think you have great balance between lights and darks.  I think this really works, well done!</td>', 'I think Weston''s shots of buildings are like American Gothic.  Matter of fact, centered, no frills, dispassionate.  I think you''ve accomplished that here.  I think you have great balance between lights and darks.  I think this really works, well done!', '2011-03-31 23:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369237, 942597, 124346, '<td valign="top">What''s wrong with his eyes?</td>', 'What''s wrong with his eyes?', '2011-03-31 23:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369300, 943663, 129091, '<td valign="top">Great texture and light!  <br/>.</td>', 'Great texture and light!  .', '2011-04-01 00:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369306, 943616, 129091, '<td valign="top">I like this!</td>', 'I like this!', '2011-04-01 00:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369374, 943198, 126838, '<td valign="top">Nice shell...different angle? <br/>It''s a very nice SHELL...just needed bigger focus....<br/>Nice shell!...:)</td>', 'Nice shell...different angle? It''s a very nice SHELL...just needed bigger focus....Nice shell!...:)', '2011-04-01 01:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369656, 943488, 114233, '<td valign="top">Looks South African! Black Label and the horns...<br/>Pity about the camera shake though</td>', 'Looks South African! Black Label and the horns...Pity about the camera shake though', '2011-04-01 09:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369657, 943345, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is good and something Weston may have photographed. A couple drawbacks to this shot is that the light is even and possibly diffused by cloud cover making the scene fairly grey and even in tone. I think you could have just gotten closer to the main subject to make it better. If Weston were to photograph this, he would have concentrated on the one rock in the foreground. I know this because I am an expert and have studied the master thoroughly! <i>(he says with tongue in cheek!!)</i></td>', 'I think this is good and something Weston may have photographed. A couple drawbacks to this shot is that the light is even and possibly diffused by cloud cover making the scene fairly grey and even in tone. I think you could have just gotten closer to the main subject to make it better. If Weston were to photograph this, he would have concentrated on the one rock in the foreground. I know this because I am an expert and have studied the master thoroughly! (he says with tongue in cheek!!)', '2011-04-01 09:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369660, 943650, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great scene really indicative of Weston''s work. Lots of action with the smoke billowing out of the smokestacks. Overall I think the image is lacking in tonal range. You did well to limit the highlights, which I think is something Weston did often, but there is not enough shadow and dark tones... mostly mid range tones. Perhaps the contrast could have been bumped up a bit more to help out, or maybe like a red filter applied. Excellent work overall!</td>', 'Great scene really indicative of Weston''s work. Lots of action with the smoke billowing out of the smokestacks. Overall I think the image is lacking in tonal range. You did well to limit the highlights, which I think is something Weston did often, but there is not enough shadow and dark tones... mostly mid range tones. Perhaps the contrast could have been bumped up a bit more to help out, or maybe like a red filter applied. Excellent work overall!', '2011-04-01 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369665, 942722, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent black and white photo. I just think it is not really indicative of Weston''s work. I think there is too much gaussian blur applied. Weston''s subjects and even his backgrounds were really sharp and in focus showing off the details and textures in my opinion. This is a great image that I would otherwise vote higher on in a different challenge.</td>', 'This is an excellent black and white photo. I just think it is not really indicative of Weston''s work. I think there is too much gaussian blur applied. Weston''s subjects and even his backgrounds were really sharp and in focus showing off the details and textures in my opinion. This is a great image that I would otherwise vote higher on in a different challenge.', '2011-04-01 09:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6369666, 943598, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting form! Very Ent-like...</td>', 'Interesting form! Very Ent-like...', '2011-04-01 09:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
