(6375609, 942735, 124256, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Based on my take of Weston I''d like to see more lights, I think his shots are more balanced that way.  I also think this shot would be more Westony more tightly cropped.  Regardless, I this this is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice.  Based on my take of Weston I''d like to see more lights, I think his shots are more balanced that way.  I also think this shot would be more Westony more tightly cropped.  Regardless, I this this is a great shot.', '2011-04-05 23:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375616, 942740, 124256, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject for this challenge.  I think I''d like it significantly more if the background was darker offering a starker contrast with the subject.  Still, I think against the odds this comes off as a nice Westony shot.</td>', 'Interesting subject for this challenge.  I think I''d like it significantly more if the background was darker offering a starker contrast with the subject.  Still, I think against the odds this comes off as a nice Westony shot.', '2011-04-05 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375635, 943598, 124256, '<td valign="top">I think this barely works.  I wish there were more darks for my read of Weston''s style.  Still, somehow I think it does look Westony.</td>', 'I think this barely works.  I wish there were more darks for my read of Weston''s style.  Still, somehow I think it does look Westony.', '2011-04-05 23:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375645, 943332, 124256, '<td valign="top">Neat.  I like your subject for the challenge.  It seems like a pretty original take while still capturing the Weston style in an obvious way.  Well done.</td>', 'Neat.  I like your subject for the challenge.  It seems like a pretty original take while still capturing the Weston style in an obvious way.  Well done.', '2011-04-05 23:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375650, 943003, 124256, '<td valign="top">It looks out of focus to me, and even if it isn''t, I think sharp focus is an important part of Weston''s style.  The lighting seems harsh for Weston, and I wish the background was darker and there were more light areas for more Westony balance.</td>', 'It looks out of focus to me, and even if it isn''t, I think sharp focus is an important part of Weston''s style.  The lighting seems harsh for Weston, and I wish the background was darker and there were more light areas for more Westony balance.', '2011-04-05 23:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6375655, 943652, 124256, '<td valign="top">I struggled with this one, but consistently like it.  I think this somehow captures both Weston''s pepper/shell/etc style as well as his building/door/window style.  Impressive.</td>', 'I struggled with this one, but consistently like it.  I think this somehow captures both Weston''s pepper/shell/etc style as well as his building/door/window style.  Impressive.', '2011-04-05 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
