(6375986, 942775, 54645, '<td valign="top">My type of image. I saw, and still see, two images in this frame. Well done, even if it is out of the ordinary for what we normally attribute to Weston''s style.</td>', 'My type of image. I saw, and still see, two images in this frame. Well done, even if it is out of the ordinary for what we normally attribute to Weston''s style.', '2011-04-06 02:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6375995, 943290, 54645, '<td valign="top">Stunning. How this finished way down here I will never understand. You somehow managed to create a strong mix of dimensions/depth. It''s as if he is peeling off a wall, from dark to light.<br/> <br/>ETA: I just noticed I finished a place below, an honor! ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-06 01:15:18.</i></td>', 'Stunning. How this finished way down here I will never understand. You somehow managed to create a strong mix of dimensions/depth. It''s as if he is peeling off a wall, from dark to light. ETA: I just noticed I finished a place below, an honor! ;)', '2011-04-06 02:14:19.000000', '2011-04-06 02:15:18.000000', 0),
(6376003, 943668, 51638, '<td valign="top"><i>Ouch for the 12 1''s that I got. Was it really that bad to deserve a 1?</i> <br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge, but completely agree with Robert''s comment and share your obvious frustration. Anyone who''s ever examined Weston''s shots realises that nudes were a significant part of his body of work. So for folks to vote in this challenge and then dole out 1s to nude shots is plainly idiotic IMO. Without the 1s you''d have finished with a 6+ score, which is what this shot deserved.<br/> <br/>ETA: Glad to see the ridiculous 1s removed with the recalculation of votes. That''s helped your score somewhat. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-09 21:26:52.</i></td>', 'Ouch for the 12 1''s that I got. Was it really that bad to deserve a 1?  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but completely agree with Robert''s comment and share your obvious frustration. Anyone who''s ever examined Weston''s shots realises that nudes were a significant part of his body of work. So for folks to vote in this challenge and then dole out 1s to nude shots is plainly idiotic IMO. Without the 1s you''d have finished with a 6+ score, which is what this shot deserved. ETA: Glad to see the ridiculous 1s removed with the recalculation of votes. That''s helped your score somewhat. :)', '2011-04-06 02:21:52.000000', '2011-04-09 22:26:52.000000', 0),
(6376004, 943497, 113591, '<td valign="top">Ek het gedink die een is joune, na aanleiding van jou kommentaar in die voorskoupraatblad. 8 van my af. My hoogste, ek reken jy het die kleurskema net reg ontwikkel om Westonrig te wees.</td>', 'Ek het gedink die een is joune, na aanleiding van jou kommentaar in die voorskoupraatblad. 8 van my af. My hoogste, ek reken jy het die kleurskema net reg ontwikkel om Westonrig te wees.', '2011-04-06 02:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
