(6376008, 943627, 16106, '<td valign="top">He he he. 29th place. Oh well, you were my only 10. The ribbon winners were ones I though, "Oh very nice but nothing like Weston" . At least the voters are consistent, over in the other challenge few of the front page are more than a few parts, very little disassembly, why should Weston be different?</td>', 'He he he. 29th place. Oh well, you were my only 10. The ribbon winners were ones I though, "Oh very nice but nothing like Weston" . At least the voters are consistent, over in the other challenge few of the front page are more than a few parts, very little disassembly, why should Weston be different?', '2011-04-06 02:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
