(6376011, 943199, 16106, '<td valign="top">One of my top 5, what is it doing down here in the middle of the pack? At least the folks who commented during the challenge know a thing or two. And you got less 1 votes than I did in the other challenge.<br/> <br/>It is a lovely shot.</td>', 'One of my top 5, what is it doing down here in the middle of the pack? At least the folks who commented during the challenge know a thing or two. And you got less 1 votes than I did in the other challenge. It is a lovely shot.', '2011-04-06 02:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
