(6376230, 942650, 76335, '<td valign="top">I gave it a six -- partly because I didn''t get back around to bump scores, partly because that nail is too long.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-06 19:44:07.</i></td>', 'I gave it a six -- partly because I didn''t get back around to bump scores, partly because that nail is too long.', '2011-04-06 08:43:30.000000', '2011-04-06 20:44:07.000000', 0),
