(6376309, 943309, 101707, '<td valign="top">Great shot Johanna. It looks like a kapow to the face. I gave you a 7 for such a well done and powerful image. The only criticism is some slightly blown highlights, but that is minor.</td>', 'Great shot Johanna. It looks like a kapow to the face. I gave you a 7 for such a well done and powerful image. The only criticism is some slightly blown highlights, but that is minor.', '2011-04-06 10:20:19.000000', NULL, 0),
