(6377341, 943290, 18367, '<td valign="top">I honestly believed that this image would end up on the front page and I am truly saddened by the number of 1 scores you received.  <br/> <br/>I took the time to visit and study images done by Weston as I was not familiar with his work, and found this to be very similar to his style.  Very nicely done... sadly your efforts were not appreciated at their true value.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'I honestly believed that this image would end up on the front page and I am truly saddened by the number of 1 scores you received.   I took the time to visit and study images done by Weston as I was not familiar with his work, and found this to be very similar to his style.  Very nicely done... sadly your efforts were not appreciated at their true value. Ray', '2011-04-07 00:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
